  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 4 of The Naked Director. On the day their very first Tokyo video finally hits rental stores, Kawada, Toshi, and Muranishi eagerly visit a neighborhood shop to see their display. Listen to the Japanese conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "延滞してないですか？次からちゃんと巻き戻しといてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どうも、社長。いやあ、すごい映画が出てきたもんだよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "これ間違いなくシリーズ化するだろうね。で、今日何の用？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ついにうちの作品が店頭に並ぶ日なんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "何かいても立ってもいられなくなっちゃってね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ああ、置いてあるよ。見てみれば。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どこだろう、えっと、こっちかな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "いや、そんな上じゃないよ。下、もっと下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "で、ずっと行って右、右。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "右、右…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これだけですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "そうだよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "延滞してないですか？次からちゃんと巻き戻しといてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are these tapes overdue? Be sure to rewind them properly next time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どうも、社長。いやあ、すごい映画が出てきたもんだよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello there. My, what an incredible movie has come out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "これ間違いなくシリーズ化するだろうね。で、今日何の用？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They will definitely turn this into a series. So, what brings you in today?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ついにうちの作品が店頭に並ぶ日なんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today is finally the day our own video hits store shelves.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "何かいても立ってもいられなくなっちゃってね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Somehow we just couldn't sit still waiting at the office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ああ、置いてあるよ。見てみれば。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, it's out on the rack. Go take a look.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どこだろう、えっと、こっちかな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where could it be — let's see, over this way?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "いや、そんな上じゃないよ。下、もっと下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, not up that high. Lower — way lower.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "で、ずっと行って右、右。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then keep going all the way over to the far right.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "右、右…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To the right, right...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これだけですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this single copy all you have?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "そうだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yep, that's it.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
